    "task": "Every lane receives the same immutable logical task: one source string '@@@' + grammar-intersection number + ']', source offset 3, and the same declared consumed end before ']'.",
    "prefix_and_offset": "Inside every timed lane invocation the same extract(task) checks the original source bounds and slices source[offset,end]. Every exact implementation therefore consumes the identical token from local offset 0; normalize rebases its complete local end to the same original UTF-16 end. Prefix extraction and rebasing are inside every measured operation.",
